{"id":"n99439253b4","headline":"Trump Warns Oman Amid Iran Strait Talks","summary":"President Trump has threatened military action against Oman if it interferes with U.S. negotiations over the Strait of Hormuz. The warning comes as the U.S.-Iran Memorandum of Understanding nears expiration.","why":"The Strait of Hormuz is a key chokepoint for seaborne oil shipments from the Gulf, so disruption there directly affects global crude supply and prices. Oman is a Gulf state that borders the strait.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"geopolitics","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Muscat","country":"Oman","lat":23.59,"lon":58.41,"region":"me"},"entities":[{"name":"Brent crude","ticker":"BZ=F","kind":"company","sym":"BRENT","asset":{"id":"CM:BRENT","n":"Brent crude oil","c":"commodity","px":"BZ=F","la":57.5,"lo":1.5,"geo":"markets","site":"BRENT","m":"ticker-fixed","rv":"registry-v1"}}],"links":[],"source":{"name":"NewsRadio WHAM 1180","url":"https://wham1180.iheart.com/content/2026-08-17-trump-warns-oman-amid-iran-strait-talks/"},"sources":[{"name":"NewsRadio WHAM 1180","url":"https://wham1180.iheart.com/content/2026-08-17-trump-warns-oman-amid-iran-strait-talks/"}],"published_at":"2026-08-17T16:19:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"094cf10806d39f91","impacts":[],"why_moved":"The threat ties U.S. policy on Iran to Hormuz, a critical oil transit route, and the nearing expiry of the U.S.-Iran memorandum adds uncertainty over shipping access.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-17T16:19:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-17T18:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"MU","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-tanker-ship-5404576.jpg","alt":"oil tanker shi